@startuml gear_transmission
!theme plain

title Gear Transmission Example

left to right direction

component "Velocity source\n(command [rad/s])" as Source
component "GearTransmission\nmodel" as Gear
component "Position sink\n(output [rad])" as Sink

Source --> Gear : velocity_command
Gear --> Sink : position

note right of Gear
  Motor inertia, load inertia,
  damping, stiffness and
  gear ratio are integrated
  with a 1 ms period.
end note

@enduml
